[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて、他に質問はないかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, any other questions?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナは旅の補佐役、とのことですけど……\n異邦人の方々もそうだと、以前仰っていましたね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You mentioned Alvina was meant to assist us on our journey... You said the same thing about the wanderers before, didn't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうよ。彼らは私たちパルメ族が呼んだの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. We of the Palme summoned them here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ということは、元の世界に戻す方法も、\n師匠たちなら知っているということですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then does that mean you know how to send them back to their original worlds?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん。だってすべてが終わったらちゃんと\nそれぞれ元の世界に返す予定だから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. After all, we plan to return everyone to their respective worlds once everything is over."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！\u3000やっぱり、そうなんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I knew it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、それは錬金術の復興という目的を\n果たした後の話だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "However, that will only happen after you've fulfilled your purpose of reviving alchemy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のお前たちが気にかける必要はない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You needn't concern yourselves with that now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そろそろ夜も明ける頃ね。\n今回はこのへんでお開きにしましょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dawn will be breaking soon. Shall we end our discussion here for today?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、待ってください！\u3000話はまだ――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wait! We still have more to discuss—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これ以上、話すべきことはもうない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There is nothing more to be said at this time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のところは順調なようだけれど……泣き言を言わず、\n自力で果ての大陸へたどり着けるかどうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Things seem to be progressing smoothly so far... but I'll be watching to see if you can reach World's End through your own efforts, like you proclaimed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この先も、しっかり見守っているわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll be keeping a close eye on you from here on out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Sigh."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ヴァレリア、アルビーナ……\n\u3000無理もないよね。急にあんなこと聞かされたら）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Valeria, Alvina... I can't blame them. Being told something like that out of nowhere...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……みんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Everyone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "少し、整理する時間が必要だと思う。\nこれからどうしていくべきなのか、どうしたいのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think we all need some time to process this. To figure out what we should do next... and what we want to do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I agree..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "気が済むまで考えて、たっぷりお休みもとって……\nその後で、また集まって話し合おう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Take all the time you need to think, get plenty of rest... and then we'll gather again to talk things through."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様。今日聞いたこと、\nヤンネさんには話しておいたほうがいいと思う",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, I think we should tell Janne about what we learned today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうだね。三人で話し合おっか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You're right. Let's talk about it, the three of us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、ひとまず解散！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright then, meeting adjourned!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]